{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "402563b5-a74f-83fc-9d06-378f564aae8a",
  "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:22:58-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Holly Sherman",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:19:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:19:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello? Hi, is this Public Works? Hello?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:20:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, you've got Public Works. I'm here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:20:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sorry, I'm on speakerphone, my hands are full. Hello, you can still hear me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:20:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:20:14-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So, um, there's a storm drain, a catch basin, in front of our place, and a snowbank is sitting right on top of it. And the water can't get in, so it's pooling all the way across the lane. It's been like that for days. Hello?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:20:31-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Still here. Is it snowing now, or is this from earlier melting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:20:36-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's the thing, there's no storm. It's dry out. It's just the melt from the plow pile, it runs down and sits there, and then it freezes at night. [pause] Hello? Sorry, I just like to check you're still there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:20:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm still with you. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:20:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 466 Rhode Island Avenue, in the Historic Hill neighborhood. The drain is right out front by the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:21:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 466 Rhode Island Avenue. Let me pull up the notes on that spot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:21:07-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can you tell me when they last came by? Because I'm looking at my notes here, hold on, [pause] I wrote down that I've seen nobody clear it since the plows went through last week. Hello?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:21:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, still here. I'm not seeing a crew visit logged for that drain recently. Nothing from this week at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:21:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course not. So nobody has been out, and it's just been sitting there. I mean, that's what I figured, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:21:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. That's a fair thing to be annoyed about."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:21:41-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And there's an older woman next door, she's in her eighties, and she can't get out. She won't walk through that, it's all slush and ice over the lane. Her ride couldn't even pull up yesterday. Hello? Are you there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:21:55-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm here, I'm writing that down. That makes it a priority, a neighbor who can't get out safely. I'll put it in as a blocked catch basin with ice across the lane."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:22:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So when will somebody come? Because I've said this kind of thing before and it just, it never gets done."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:22:15-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll flag it for the next crew run on the Hill. Probably within a day or two, depending on what else comes in. Can I get a callback number in case it changes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:22:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's 401-555-0194."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:22:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0194. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:22:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Holly Sherman. Hello? Sorry, did you get that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:22:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Holly Sherman, yes. I have it all. If it freezes over worse before they get there, call back and we'll note it again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:22:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I just want it actually cleared this time. Not a note in a file."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:22:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. It's in the queue now with the address and the neighbor noted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:22:56-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. Bye."
    }
  ],
